WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.939 --> 00:00:06.060
Hey youtubers it’s Charlie and this week
Supernatural took a relaxing spa break from

00:00:06.060 --> 00:00:09.910
the war for heaven and hell in what I like
to think of as a cross between an X-Files

00:00:09.910 --> 00:00:11.790
episode and a Scooby Doo Mystery.

00:00:11.790 --> 00:00:15.630
Extra special shoutout for LunchLady Dean,
second only to Dog Dean.

00:00:15.630 --> 00:00:18.520
Quick heads up before we get started, because
olympics supernatural isn’t back until feb

00:00:18.520 --> 00:00:19.520
25th in three weeks.

00:00:19.520 --> 00:00:20.520
So if you’re looking to re-watch an episode.

00:00:20.520 --> 00:00:24.490
I would recommend first born or anything with
abaddon and crowley in it.

00:00:24.490 --> 00:00:29.570
Since this episode was tailor made for funny
bits let’s do our Top 5 funniest moments

00:00:29.570 --> 00:00:30.950
and then I’ll do my review.

00:00:30.950 --> 00:00:34.210
Number 5 - Sheriff Donna, Dean and The Donuts.

00:00:34.210 --> 00:00:36.929
Dean eating like a pig is always hilarious.

00:00:36.929 --> 00:00:40.510
But we have to give credit to Sheriff Donna
for being his wingman on this joke.

00:00:40.510 --> 00:00:44.399
She’s just casually stuffing her face with
white powder on her lips when the camera cuts

00:00:44.399 --> 00:00:48.929
to Dean licking his fingers and looking like
he just stuck his whole face in that box of

00:00:48.929 --> 00:00:49.929
donuts.

00:00:49.929 --> 00:00:54.879
The best part is that Donna and Dean don’t
acknowledge it at all and Sam just sighs.

00:00:54.879 --> 00:00:55.879
uuggh.

00:00:55.879 --> 00:00:57.079
Number 4 - We Have All Kinds of Certifications.

00:00:57.079 --> 00:01:02.281
They gave away lunchlady dean in the teaser
last week, so this wasn’t a surprise, but

00:01:02.281 --> 00:01:05.330
just the preposition of dean in a hairnet
is epic.

00:01:05.330 --> 00:01:07.620
He gets all the best fake jobs.

00:01:07.620 --> 00:01:11.190
Not to be outdone though, the idea of richard
simmons Sam was good.

00:01:11.190 --> 00:01:15.430
Seriously though, can we talk about how Dean
is always the one to jump in head first to

00:01:15.430 --> 00:01:16.430
crazy situations.

00:01:16.430 --> 00:01:17.430
And Sam always follows along.

00:01:17.430 --> 00:01:19.010
It’s like Sam is still a little kid following
big brother dean around.

00:01:19.010 --> 00:01:20.630
Even though he’s way taller and kind of
hates him right now.

00:01:20.630 --> 00:01:23.220
Number 3 - Downward Dog for 5 minutes.

00:01:23.220 --> 00:01:27.380
I’ve actually done yoga and 5 minutes in
one pose is a lot, but it’s not that bad.

00:01:27.380 --> 00:01:29.420
I loved the look on everyone’s faces.

00:01:29.420 --> 00:01:34.040
And the idea that Sam knew yoga because he
“dated someone bendy too”.

00:01:34.040 --> 00:01:36.270
Number 2 - The Fat Vampires.

00:01:36.270 --> 00:01:39.000
Saying it that way makes it sound like a really
bad Twilight spinoff.

00:01:39.000 --> 00:01:43.210
But as gross as it was, it was really watching
sam and dean react to it all.

00:01:43.210 --> 00:01:47.850
I couldn’t stop mentally associating the
pudding with the jars of fat in the fridge.

00:01:47.850 --> 00:01:52.000
If you’re able to get through a cupping
session after this you are a champ.

00:01:52.000 --> 00:01:54.800
Number 1 - Something is in the pudding.

00:01:54.800 --> 00:01:59.180
Dean getting roofied is a little dark just
because of what roofies are normally associated

00:01:59.180 --> 00:02:00.180
with.

00:02:00.180 --> 00:02:03.560
But just watching him lust after the pudding
was the funniest part of the episode.

00:02:03.560 --> 00:02:07.180
You have lunchlady dean getting dumped on
by his supervisor, who then tells him he can’t

00:02:07.180 --> 00:02:08.180
touch the pudding.

00:02:08.180 --> 00:02:11.050
So naturally Dean immediately runs off with
some.

00:02:11.050 --> 00:02:14.200
How great is it that he ran into the closet
to eat it.

00:02:14.200 --> 00:02:17.640
I just want a clip reel of Sam catching Dean
eating in weird places.

00:02:17.640 --> 00:02:19.840
Like catching a dog eating off the table.

00:02:19.840 --> 00:02:21.470
That’s a bad dean, that’s a bad bad dean.

00:02:21.470 --> 00:02:23.920
I just see the crestfallen look on his face
now.

00:02:23.920 --> 00:02:25.830
I’m sorry, i was hungry.

00:02:25.830 --> 00:02:29.520
Let me know what your favorite moment was,
are you team yoga or team lunchlady.

00:02:29.520 --> 00:02:32.790
I have to say, I’m lunch lady all the way.

00:02:32.790 --> 00:02:35.390
I even sang the adam sandler song a little
when he showed up with the hairnet on.

00:02:35.390 --> 00:02:39.520
Overall I had to give the episode a B minus
just because it was a retread of old material

00:02:39.520 --> 00:02:40.760
in a new setting.

00:02:40.760 --> 00:02:45.190
Plus sometimes Dean and Sam’s attitude’s
on monsters and killing is inconsistent.

00:02:45.190 --> 00:02:47.950
In fairness to dean hating monsters, he still
has that mark of cain.

00:02:47.950 --> 00:02:50.380
So that might be making him aggro way more.

00:02:50.380 --> 00:02:54.350
I did have fun with the fat vampire twist
and the whole concept of the weightloss spa.

00:02:54.350 --> 00:02:58.630
The health nut slash eating disorder satire
was a nice moral throughline.

00:02:58.630 --> 00:03:02.260
Moderation is key, in all things both monster
and winchester.

00:03:02.260 --> 00:03:05.290
If only dean could just learn to chill on
all the instant gratification.

00:03:05.290 --> 00:03:09.600
I think the big journey for Dean this season
in addition to killing abaddon is learning

00:03:09.600 --> 00:03:10.760
to be a real human being.

00:03:10.760 --> 00:03:13.610
He’s kind of been living this parody life
up to this point.

00:03:13.610 --> 00:03:17.670
Which is probably why he didn’t know how
to live without Sam and why he can never settle

00:03:17.670 --> 00:03:18.670
down.

00:03:18.670 --> 00:03:21.930
This deep in the season I feel like they really
need to be focusing on those main plot lines.

00:03:21.930 --> 00:03:22.930
Like Crowley, Abaddon,Castiel and Metatron.

00:03:22.930 --> 00:03:25.610
Gadreel is kind of like a second tier character
at this point.

00:03:25.610 --> 00:03:30.670
I’m 99 percent sure they’ll get a season
10, so the real question is if Dean is going

00:03:30.670 --> 00:03:35.319
to learn anything as a character, or if he’ll
still be dealing with the same personal issues

00:03:35.319 --> 00:03:36.319
next year.

00:03:36.319 --> 00:03:40.930
Let me know what you think yes or no, is Dean
going to be the same old dean in season 10.

00:03:40.930 --> 00:03:44.959
If you didn’t see, I just posted a big preview
of grant gustin’s flash tv show.

00:03:44.959 --> 00:03:48.520
Click here to learn all about it and click
here for last week’s supernatural.

00:03:48.520 --> 00:03:50.800
Thanks for watching, see you guys tonight,
high fives!

